    "message": "feat(skill): ship the ix agent skill with Compass patch, API docs, and upstream port\n\nAdds the self-contained ix agent skill (SKILL.md, references, bootstrap\nscripts, and the Compass fit-view patch) that teaches any LLM agent to drive\nthe ix CLI, plus the supporting artifacts produced while building it:\n\n- skills/ix: the skill itself — command routing, output-format rules,\n  troubleshooting, first-run bootstrap for bash and PowerShell, and the\n  compass-patch (F fit-view, hint/no-map chips with live theme re-sampling,\n  and a real /__ix/remap endpoint)\n- upstream/compass-fit-view: React port of the fit-view feature destined for\n  the real Compass codebase\n- docs/api: backend HTTP API reference and an OpenAPI 3.0 spec\n- scripts/install-skill.sh: one-shot deploy to ~/.claude/skills and\n  ~/.agents/skills\n- README: skill section; CLAUDE.md: project context and verified gotchas\n- .gitignore: dist/, .freebuff/, .understand-anything/\n\nGenerated with Codebuff 🤖\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
